WEBVTT

01:30.520 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:36.880 --> 01:39.520
Given our sect's great contributions
in resisting the Dark Clan

01:39.600 --> 01:43.760
over the millennium, I hope you won't
hold it accountable for my actions.

01:47.920 --> 01:48.960
I won't.

01:53.600 --> 01:55.200
Thank you, Mr. Xie.

01:59.280 --> 02:00.640
Mr. Xie,

02:00.720 --> 02:02.000
there's one last thing.

02:03.920 --> 02:05.760
May I see Xuan Xin one last time?

02:07.720 --> 02:08.840
All right.

02:24.040 --> 02:28.640
I told you to put on more layers
in this cold weather.

02:30.360 --> 02:31.920
Why didn't you listen?

02:40.880 --> 02:41.720
Master,

02:43.720 --> 02:45.200
have you made up your mind?

02:48.400 --> 02:49.920
I am different from the others.

02:50.920 --> 02:52.840
I wasn't possessed by a Dark Clan member.

02:53.640 --> 02:55.000
Nor was I coerced by anyone.

02:56.040 --> 02:59.640
Every choice I made
was of my own will.

03:00.360 --> 03:04.120
It's only right for me
to take responsibility for it.

03:21.200 --> 03:23.360
Master, you once said
I had no attachments,

03:25.520 --> 03:26.360
but now I realize

03:28.600 --> 03:29.760
that isn't true.

03:30.440 --> 03:31.520
Master,

03:34.280 --> 03:36.160
I don't want you to die.

03:39.160 --> 03:41.960
I believe in you.

03:42.880 --> 03:45.480
You have innate wisdom
and a pure, clear mind.

03:47.400 --> 03:48.760
From today onward,

03:48.840 --> 03:51.280
you will be the new leader
of Xuantian Sect.

03:52.360 --> 03:54.640
You will help Mr. Xie quell the chaos

03:55.520 --> 03:57.760
and lead Xuantian Sect

03:58.280 --> 04:01.160
to find a new path to protect the world.

04:02.480 --> 04:05.200
Promise me you will do it.

04:10.400 --> 04:11.440
Master,

04:12.920 --> 04:14.280
I promise.

04:20.399 --> 04:22.160
It's hard to judge
the matters of the world.

04:22.800 --> 04:24.520
That's why we need rules.

04:26.200 --> 04:27.720
Don't blame Mr. Xie,

04:28.600 --> 04:30.120
and don't resent anyone.

04:32.640 --> 04:35.360
The one person
I could never bear to deceive

04:36.200 --> 04:37.880
is you.

04:38.880 --> 04:40.640
The seal I gave you that night was real.

04:42.080 --> 04:43.360
That day,

04:43.440 --> 04:46.280
in the Hall of Integrity,
everyone had inner demons,

04:46.360 --> 04:49.320
but not everyone
would fall into the demonic path.

04:50.120 --> 04:52.320
In the end, it all depends on oneself

04:52.400 --> 04:54.320
to suppress desires

04:55.160 --> 04:57.720
and make the right choice.

05:00.160 --> 05:01.520
There isn't

05:02.760 --> 05:04.840
a standard answer
for the affairs of the world.

05:05.480 --> 05:06.960
So, Xuan Xin,

05:08.120 --> 05:09.560
walk your own path

05:09.640 --> 05:11.800
and find your own answers.

05:13.040 --> 05:14.040
This is

05:16.240 --> 05:18.040
the last thing I'll ever teach you.

05:22.560 --> 05:23.400
Master…

05:25.640 --> 05:26.800
Go back.

05:28.600 --> 05:29.920
I want to finish

05:31.120 --> 05:32.840
the final part of this journey myself.

07:40.920 --> 07:43.840
BRIGHT SNOWY PAVILION

07:52.920 --> 07:54.160
This is the All-Seeing Jade Dragon Array.

07:54.760 --> 07:56.280
It can be used to monitor
the movements of the Spirit Clan.

08:03.880 --> 08:05.360
In such troubled times,

08:07.320 --> 08:09.720
thank you, Mr. Nan,
for your strong assistance.

08:11.200 --> 08:14.000
No need to thank me.
I'm just glad it's useful.

08:15.800 --> 08:18.640
How are Xuechen and Miss Mu recently?

08:18.720 --> 08:20.320
The news of Saint Yinian's passing

08:20.400 --> 08:21.720
has been spread to all the sects.

08:21.800 --> 08:24.080
The Lord just finished
handling the aftermath.

08:25.320 --> 08:26.440
As for Mu Xuanling,

08:27.800 --> 08:29.360
she's fine.

08:29.440 --> 08:30.480
She's been resting
at the Swirling Snow Pavilion.

08:32.240 --> 08:33.480
However,

08:37.240 --> 08:38.960
there's been quite a lot of gossip.

08:39.039 --> 08:41.000
But since the Lord doesn't mind,

08:41.080 --> 08:42.320
I haven't said anything about it.

08:44.880 --> 08:45.760
I'll return to report now.

08:47.040 --> 08:48.040
Goodbye.

08:50.480 --> 08:51.480
Take care.

09:26.760 --> 09:28.120
I've never seen

09:28.200 --> 09:29.480
such a carefree prisoner before.

09:35.200 --> 09:36.480
When you have backing,

09:36.560 --> 09:38.000
your mood will naturally be different.

09:38.080 --> 09:39.320
What brings you here, Mr. Nan?

09:40.520 --> 09:41.800
I've been thinking

09:43.000 --> 09:45.040
maybe it's time I returned
to Greenview Heights.

09:48.400 --> 09:49.360
I get it.

09:49.440 --> 09:51.640
You never wanted to get involved
in the Immortal Alliance's conflicts.

09:52.160 --> 09:53.960
You only came here to help Xie Xuechen.

09:54.920 --> 09:57.200
Now, the three demon projections
have been extinguished.

09:57.280 --> 09:58.440
The traitors within the alliance
have been caught.

09:59.240 --> 10:01.360
The Pearl Tower
is well-guarded by the sects.

10:01.440 --> 10:03.400
And Xie Xuechen has fully regained
his strength.

10:03.480 --> 10:04.640
It's time for you to go back
and live freely again.

10:06.480 --> 10:07.440
What about you?

10:09.360 --> 10:11.920
I'm a prisoner of Snow City now.

10:12.680 --> 10:13.840
I'm at ease, but still bound.

10:14.520 --> 10:16.160
The Immortal Alliance won't let me go.

10:20.760 --> 10:24.200
Are you really not considering
going to Greenview Heights?

10:26.680 --> 10:27.680
Mr. Nan,

10:28.800 --> 10:31.560
you've done so much for me.

10:33.400 --> 10:36.800
Why take such risks
for a mere old acquaintance?

10:41.680 --> 10:43.080
You're more than just an acquaintance.

10:45.000 --> 10:46.720
In fact, back then at Moonlight Heights,

10:48.480 --> 10:50.040
I wanted to take you with me.

10:52.040 --> 10:53.320
If I had,

10:54.400 --> 10:56.240
you wouldn't have met

10:57.320 --> 10:59.000
Xie Xuechen or Sang Qi,

11:00.440 --> 11:02.320
and you wouldn't have spent
ten years in the Dark Abyss

11:03.840 --> 11:06.600
or become the demoness
the Immortal Alliance wants to execute.

11:09.120 --> 11:10.120
Mu Xuanling,

11:13.560 --> 11:14.840
I really regret it.

11:19.520 --> 11:23.280
I've never given you anything,
and I barely did anything for you.

11:24.640 --> 11:26.680
You don't need to feel this way.

11:27.880 --> 11:30.440
-You did give me something.
-I…

11:32.280 --> 11:34.080
You just don't realize it.

11:36.000 --> 11:38.560
Do you want to hear a secret of mine?

11:40.800 --> 11:41.640
I won't tell anyone.

11:45.160 --> 11:46.160
In fact,

11:46.840 --> 11:48.280
my three apertures weren't destroyed

11:49.240 --> 11:50.800
by the Dark Clan.

11:55.400 --> 11:56.440
My brother did it.

11:57.560 --> 11:59.040
He colluded with evil cultivators

11:59.600 --> 12:02.000
and kidnapped me,
disguised as a Dark Clan member.

12:03.080 --> 12:06.000
Xingye, you're also my son,

12:06.760 --> 12:09.680
but since you harmed
your own elder brother,

12:10.480 --> 12:13.600
I have
no choice but to do this!

12:14.320 --> 12:16.600
I did conspire with others
to destroy his three apertures

12:17.200 --> 12:18.240
and cripple his legs.

12:18.320 --> 12:19.200
But what's so wrong with that?

12:19.840 --> 12:22.480
If I hadn't,
would you have even noticed me?

12:22.560 --> 12:23.640
Enough!

12:24.240 --> 12:25.680
You ungrateful brat,

12:25.760 --> 12:27.160
I'll kill you!

12:28.080 --> 12:29.840
I told Xingye to do all this!

12:30.720 --> 12:32.200
Nan Xuyue's three apertures
have all been destroyed.

12:32.280 --> 12:33.240
He's no longer capable of cultivation.

12:33.840 --> 12:34.960
But Xingye is already
at the Golden Core stage.

12:35.040 --> 12:36.080
He has a chance
to reach the Spiritual Form stage.

12:36.160 --> 12:37.400
Are you sure you want to ruin

12:37.480 --> 12:39.640
Greenview Heights' last hope
for a cripple?

12:52.040 --> 12:53.280
I'll atone for the sins with my life.

12:53.360 --> 12:55.240
If you want to kill anyone, kill me!

12:55.320 --> 12:57.600
Get out of my way! I'll kill you!

12:58.480 --> 12:59.320
Mother!

13:01.520 --> 13:02.560
She took the fall for Nan Xingye,

13:03.840 --> 13:05.680
-bearing all the blame.
-Mother!

13:06.800 --> 13:10.480
To this day, I still can't forget
the way she looked just before she died.

13:10.560 --> 13:11.840
Mother!

13:11.920 --> 13:13.480
She almost seemed content,

13:14.800 --> 13:16.760
thinking her life was a small price to pay

13:18.280 --> 13:19.640
for her son to get everything.

13:20.600 --> 13:22.360
And she believed that was worth it.

13:28.000 --> 13:29.680
At first, I was angry

13:30.840 --> 13:33.000
at my father's favoritism and injustice,

13:33.080 --> 13:34.760
but at that moment,

13:35.520 --> 13:37.240
all I felt was envy.

13:38.640 --> 13:40.760
I envied that my brother had someone

13:40.840 --> 13:43.240
who loved him so much
they would gladly die for him,

13:46.360 --> 13:50.920
while I was destined
never to meet anyone like that.

13:52.680 --> 13:54.280
But then I met you.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.400
You promised

14:00.440 --> 14:02.200
to give me a little bit of affection.

14:02.280 --> 14:04.800
Give me some of your candy,

14:04.880 --> 14:06.800
and I'll give you a little bit

14:07.400 --> 14:08.880
of my affection.

14:11.240 --> 14:14.320
That was just
an unintentional remark.

14:18.640 --> 14:19.960
I know.

14:21.840 --> 14:23.920
But then we met again years later,

14:24.000 --> 14:26.640
and I saw how much you loved
and sacrificed for Xie Xuechen.

14:26.720 --> 14:28.240
That made me realize

14:29.200 --> 14:30.840
what I'd missed.

14:32.960 --> 14:34.320
Nan Xuyue,

14:35.600 --> 14:38.240
are you in love with me or something?

14:39.400 --> 14:40.680
I'm not sure either.

14:41.760 --> 14:45.560
I don't know if I'm in love
with you

14:45.640 --> 14:48.000
or if I'm just moved

14:48.800 --> 14:51.480
by how devotedly you love someone.

14:53.840 --> 14:55.800
So, I think I should leave.

14:55.880 --> 14:59.000
I should distance myself
from both you and him and figure out

14:59.920 --> 15:01.800
how I really feel.

15:23.520 --> 15:25.200
He… You…

15:33.280 --> 15:34.320
Let's take a walk.

15:40.840 --> 15:42.040
I…

15:44.280 --> 15:45.200
You…

15:54.480 --> 15:55.840
Why am I feeling guilty?

15:57.840 --> 15:58.880
How much did you hear?

16:00.880 --> 16:01.880
Not much.

16:02.840 --> 16:04.840
I arrived when you said you were in love.

16:09.480 --> 16:12.120
What's that look supposed to mean?
Indifference

16:12.960 --> 16:14.480
or anger?

16:19.000 --> 16:19.920
Why didn't you tell me?

16:21.000 --> 16:23.000
I haven't figured it out myself.

16:23.080 --> 16:24.280
How could I tell you?

16:25.400 --> 16:30.680
Or should I tell you that I love
the way she loves you?

16:33.800 --> 16:35.400
Wouldn't that sound strange?

16:38.360 --> 16:39.400
So, I thought I should

16:40.280 --> 16:42.400
step back a bit and figure things out.

16:43.720 --> 16:45.000
And then what?

16:46.200 --> 16:49.680
The Xie Xuechen I know
rarely presses others for answers.

16:51.200 --> 16:53.280
-Are you scared?
-No.

16:55.480 --> 16:57.320
She's crazy about you.

16:57.960 --> 16:59.280
There's nothing to worry about.

17:00.760 --> 17:03.920
I'll be
heading back to Greenview Heights soon.

17:04.000 --> 17:05.720
Don't bother seeing me off.

17:06.640 --> 17:07.720
By the way,

17:08.400 --> 17:10.440
you'd better act fast,

17:10.520 --> 17:12.119
so I can stop holding onto any hope.

17:12.720 --> 17:14.520
That way, nothing will change.

17:18.720 --> 17:19.720
Goodbye.

17:24.480 --> 17:31.440
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

17:43.240 --> 17:44.640
How did the conversation go?

17:47.520 --> 17:50.640
Nan Xuyue's confession
came as a surprise to me too.

17:53.960 --> 17:55.480
Are you upset?

17:56.680 --> 17:57.720
No.

17:58.720 --> 18:00.400
Then are we still going down
the mountain today?

18:00.480 --> 18:02.280
Of course we are. Why wouldn't we?

18:04.200 --> 18:05.600
And you said you weren't mad?

18:06.120 --> 18:09.120
The Xie Xuechen I know
wouldn't talk like this.

18:09.800 --> 18:11.080
If you don't want to go, then forget it.

18:11.160 --> 18:13.000
I'm going! I'll go even if knives
are falling from the sky!

18:23.040 --> 18:25.280
Are you really just walking me down
the mountain like this?

18:25.360 --> 18:28.240
If we get spotted,
you might get into trouble.

18:28.320 --> 18:30.920
Madam Su is already displeased

18:31.000 --> 18:32.440
that you didn't kill me.

18:44.880 --> 18:47.360
Now that my demonic power is gone,

18:47.440 --> 18:49.240
I'm no different from
a regular Spirit Clan member.

18:50.800 --> 18:52.280
This cliff is so high.

18:53.240 --> 18:54.720
It actually makes me a bit scared.

18:56.120 --> 18:57.400
But, Xie Xuechen,

18:57.480 --> 18:59.720
I've thought of a brilliant way
to avoid being seen.

19:03.120 --> 19:04.280
You…!

19:22.080 --> 19:24.000
How's that?
Doesn't look like anyone saw us, right?

19:24.080 --> 19:25.560
If you ever do that again,
I won't catch you.

19:27.880 --> 19:29.400
I just didn't want
to make things harder for you.

19:31.520 --> 19:33.480
A lot of people in the city know you.

19:33.560 --> 19:35.840
But tonight,
it's supposed to be just our time.

19:35.920 --> 19:37.360
I don't want anyone disturbing us.

19:46.480 --> 19:49.360
There. Now, no one will recognize you.

19:51.160 --> 19:52.400
Let's go.

19:55.560 --> 19:58.320
-Come and take a look!
-Amazing.

20:00.960 --> 20:03.440
-It's so lively here!
-Good!

20:03.520 --> 20:05.160
Scented sachets!

20:05.240 --> 20:06.440
Ladies, come take a look!

20:06.520 --> 20:08.080
You're slapping my hand, you know.

20:13.200 --> 20:14.280
Come and take a look!

20:19.160 --> 20:20.280
This is so much fun!

20:20.800 --> 20:22.600
-Want to make it harder?
-Yes!

20:22.680 --> 20:24.280
-Yes!
-Yes!

20:24.360 --> 20:26.400
-Yes!
-Watch closely!

20:26.920 --> 20:27.760
First throw!

20:29.080 --> 20:30.240
Second throw!

20:32.240 --> 20:33.600
The knives landed perfectly around him!

20:33.680 --> 20:35.400
Now, let's see if I can throw two at once!

20:36.880 --> 20:38.040
It's just a trick. I can do it too.

20:40.320 --> 20:42.200
Do you know that stealing the spotlight
in the human realm

20:42.280 --> 20:43.480
can get you beaten up?

20:46.120 --> 20:47.320
How would you know?

20:47.400 --> 20:48.400
Have you been beaten before?

20:50.320 --> 20:51.560
Really?

20:51.640 --> 20:52.840
You? Beaten?

20:52.920 --> 20:54.160
-Amazing!
-One more!

20:55.200 --> 20:56.400
Nice!

20:56.480 --> 20:57.600
Come on. Tell me.

20:57.680 --> 20:59.840
Who would dare beat up someone like you?

20:59.920 --> 21:02.360
It's just an old story from when
I was young. Stop asking.

21:02.440 --> 21:03.880
This is so much fun.

21:03.960 --> 21:04.960
Fine, I'll stop.

21:05.560 --> 21:07.840
It's who you are now
that matters to me anyway.

21:07.920 --> 21:10.160
-Pastries!
-How about this one?

21:10.240 --> 21:11.280
Pastries!

21:11.360 --> 21:12.720
-Pastries?
-Pastries!

21:13.400 --> 21:14.800
Pastries!

21:14.880 --> 21:16.920
Pastries fresh out of the oven.
Miss, care to try some?

21:18.960 --> 21:20.000
This one,

21:20.560 --> 21:21.880
this one, and this one.

21:21.960 --> 21:23.840
I'll try all of them!

21:23.920 --> 21:24.960
All right!

21:25.720 --> 21:26.920
You really love pastries, huh?

21:29.000 --> 21:30.760
When I was in the human world with Mister,

21:30.840 --> 21:34.120
the first snack he bought me
was a pastry.

21:36.240 --> 21:37.480
You're paying, right?

21:39.280 --> 21:40.600
Come on. Take a look!

21:42.200 --> 21:46.400
ACCURATE PREDICTIONS, UNMATCHED INSIGHTS

21:47.120 --> 21:49.800
A fortune-telling stall at the foot
of the immortal sects' mountains?

21:50.320 --> 21:52.280
That's bold.

21:58.920 --> 22:00.640
Are you a cultivator?

22:01.800 --> 22:02.640
Doesn't seem like it.

22:08.320 --> 22:10.600
Miss, you're mistaken.

22:11.400 --> 22:13.080
When it comes
to the art of fortune-telling,

22:13.160 --> 22:15.880
we mortals aren't necessarily inferior

22:15.960 --> 22:17.280
to those high-and-mighty cultivators.

22:17.360 --> 22:18.720
How so?

22:18.800 --> 22:21.480
They only predict
the fates of cultivators.

22:22.240 --> 22:23.840
And how long do cultivators live?

22:24.600 --> 22:26.560
Hundreds and even thousands of years.

22:26.640 --> 22:28.200
With such long lives,

22:28.280 --> 22:30.080
even nonsense

22:30.160 --> 22:32.560
has a good chance
of coming true eventually.

22:33.600 --> 22:36.760
But we mortals
only have a few decades to live.

22:37.360 --> 22:39.000
We don't have that kind of time.

22:40.120 --> 22:41.440
If my predictions were wrong,

22:41.960 --> 22:45.200
my stall
would be smashed within a month.

22:48.720 --> 22:49.800
That makes sense.

22:50.840 --> 22:51.840
Take, for example,

22:51.920 --> 22:53.880
the legendary Greenview Heights.

22:54.520 --> 22:57.320
They say the master there
could predict the fate

22:57.920 --> 22:59.840
of all living beings.

23:01.520 --> 23:02.960
Do you believe that?

23:03.040 --> 23:04.480
It's nonsense.

23:05.120 --> 23:07.160
If he'd truly been that powerful,

23:07.240 --> 23:10.760
the Spirit Clan
wouldn't have been able to massacre

23:11.360 --> 23:12.440
Greenview Heights.

23:14.280 --> 23:16.720
Miss, what would you like to know?

23:19.960 --> 23:21.280
My love life.

23:21.880 --> 23:24.000
What are your Four Pillars of Destiny?

23:24.960 --> 23:26.080
Four Pillars?

23:27.840 --> 23:29.360
I don't know.

23:31.840 --> 23:32.840
All right then.

23:33.680 --> 23:37.120
Miss, toss these coins onto the table,

23:37.200 --> 23:39.040
and I'll interpret the reading for you.

23:44.200 --> 23:47.920
Miss, you're currently caught
in a complicated relationship.

23:49.240 --> 23:50.600
That's true.

23:50.680 --> 23:54.760
So, do you think
this relationship will change?

23:59.640 --> 24:00.960
It's hopeless.

24:02.440 --> 24:06.400
Miss, this relationship of yours
has hit a dead end.

24:06.480 --> 24:07.440
I don't think it's going to work out.

24:08.120 --> 24:10.520
But as the saying goes,
"Out with the old, in with the new."

24:10.600 --> 24:12.600
How about this? For a few more coins,

24:12.680 --> 24:14.440
I can tell you
about your next relationship.

24:15.600 --> 24:16.440
Nonsense!

24:17.040 --> 24:18.560
You're just making things up.

24:19.240 --> 24:20.080
I'm not waiting until next month.

24:20.160 --> 24:22.040
I'll smash your stall right now!

24:22.120 --> 24:23.240
You…!

24:39.320 --> 24:40.160
My apologies.

24:43.240 --> 24:45.200
I can explain.

24:56.960 --> 24:57.880
Tell me.

24:58.760 --> 25:00.160
Why did you try to smash his stall?

25:00.240 --> 25:01.760
I didn't like his predictions.

25:01.840 --> 25:03.160
He's just an ordinary man.

25:03.880 --> 25:05.760
I'm ordinary too.

25:05.840 --> 25:07.920
He and I are evenly matched.

25:09.840 --> 25:11.920
Even without your demonic power,
you still can't behave.

25:12.880 --> 25:14.440
That's just who I am.

25:14.520 --> 25:17.440
Even 1,000 years wouldn't
be enough to teach me restraint.

25:18.120 --> 25:19.560
So,

25:22.040 --> 25:22.960
you'd better keep a close eye on me.

25:58.880 --> 25:59.960
Do you like it?

26:01.680 --> 26:03.680
-No.
-Really?

26:04.480 --> 26:05.520
Just kidding.

26:08.240 --> 26:10.000
What would you two like to eat?

26:15.800 --> 26:18.200
-Two bowls of plain noodles.
-Got it. Please wait a moment.

26:18.280 --> 26:19.440
Thank you.

26:21.200 --> 26:22.920
You seem familiar with this noodle stall.

26:23.000 --> 26:23.920
Do you come here often?

26:24.880 --> 26:26.080
I used to.

26:26.160 --> 26:27.400
But it seems

26:28.200 --> 26:29.400
the owner has changed.

26:31.840 --> 26:33.360
Here, two bowls of plain noodles.

26:34.040 --> 26:35.040
Thank you.

26:37.520 --> 26:39.680
Thank you, miss,
for helping my father the other day.

26:39.760 --> 26:41.960
These noodles are on me.

26:43.000 --> 26:44.280
Your father?

26:44.360 --> 26:45.720
Do you remember helping

26:45.800 --> 26:48.200
an elderly man on the street
a few days ago,

26:48.280 --> 26:50.720
who was sick and had his money stolen?

26:53.400 --> 26:55.120
Help! My money is stolen!

26:57.520 --> 26:58.920
You should be glad
we're in the human world.

26:59.600 --> 27:01.040
Otherwise, you'd be dead now.

27:02.320 --> 27:03.640
Please spare me!

27:05.880 --> 27:06.880
Scram.

27:07.920 --> 27:08.960
Thank you so much.

27:09.040 --> 27:12.320
Sir, why are you out
buying medicine alone at your age?

27:12.400 --> 27:15.000
-Don't you have family?
-I do have a son.

27:16.600 --> 27:17.680
How unfilial.

27:18.400 --> 27:20.800
Miss, it's not like that.

27:20.880 --> 27:22.400
I've been sick for years,

27:23.360 --> 27:25.160
and we've drained all our savings.

27:25.240 --> 27:28.240
My son works day and night
running a noodle stall

27:28.320 --> 27:30.720
to pay for my medicine.

27:31.320 --> 27:33.240
I didn't want to trouble him any further,

27:33.320 --> 27:35.760
so I came out to buy medicine myself.

27:36.360 --> 27:37.360
You're safe now.

27:38.400 --> 27:40.400
That elderly man is your father?

27:40.480 --> 27:41.680
That's right.

27:41.760 --> 27:43.080
When he came back,

27:43.160 --> 27:45.360
he told me about how you helped him.

27:45.440 --> 27:46.560
He remembered it all.

27:46.640 --> 27:47.840
Your clothes, demeanor,

27:47.920 --> 27:50.120
age, and looks.

27:50.200 --> 27:52.080
On behalf of my father,
thank you again, miss.

27:52.960 --> 27:53.960
It's nothing.

27:54.720 --> 27:57.520
After hearing about my father's encounter,

27:57.600 --> 27:59.400
my daughter said
she also wanted to be a heroine

27:59.480 --> 28:00.600
like you someday.

28:01.400 --> 28:02.640
Feng, come here.

28:04.240 --> 28:06.960
She's too shy to come greet you.

28:09.000 --> 28:11.280
Miss, you and your…

28:15.720 --> 28:16.800
He's my husband.

28:17.600 --> 28:19.960
You and your husband
are always welcome here.

28:20.040 --> 28:22.000
Whatever you order, it's on the house.

28:22.080 --> 28:23.360
In that case,

28:23.440 --> 28:24.520
we won't turn down your kindness.

28:24.600 --> 28:26.320
No problem. Enjoy your meal.

28:33.520 --> 28:34.480
Let's eat.

28:34.560 --> 28:35.680
Thanks to you,

28:35.760 --> 28:37.160
we're getting free noodles tonight.

28:50.080 --> 28:50.920
Xie Xuechen,

28:53.440 --> 28:54.440
I think I saw

28:55.560 --> 28:57.280
what the human world
is really like tonight.

29:00.960 --> 29:02.200
It's not perfect,

29:03.480 --> 29:06.200
but it's not that bad either.

29:14.040 --> 29:15.560
Feng, look, fireworks!

29:24.400 --> 29:27.960
The last time I saw fireworks
was ten years ago.

29:33.480 --> 29:35.520
Does that man really mean
that much to you?

29:38.160 --> 29:39.120
I mean your "Mister".

29:43.000 --> 29:46.240
Yes, he does.

29:46.320 --> 29:49.080
Then are you sure
you can tell him and me apart?

29:52.640 --> 29:56.520
I have a simple
yet accurate way to tell.

29:58.080 --> 29:59.080
Do you want to know?

30:02.960 --> 30:04.520
Come closer. I'll tell you.

30:09.000 --> 30:10.600
I don't have impure thoughts about Mister,

30:12.600 --> 30:13.880
but I do about you.

30:45.040 --> 30:47.040
The human world is lively,

30:47.120 --> 30:48.640
but the people there go to bed
rather early.

30:50.320 --> 30:52.000
Is midnight still early for you?

30:53.280 --> 30:55.800
-It's just such a pity.
-What do you mean?

30:58.760 --> 31:00.320
The journey is over.

31:00.400 --> 31:03.160
The prisoner of Snow City
should return to her ice prison.

31:04.800 --> 31:06.040
You don't have to go back.

31:08.000 --> 31:08.880
Then, where should I go?

31:09.680 --> 31:12.800
I can't keep staying
at the Swirling Snow Pavilion, can I?

31:13.360 --> 31:14.680
I'll arrange a place for you to stay.

31:15.800 --> 31:17.120
Honestly,

31:17.200 --> 31:18.800
it doesn't matter where I stay.

31:19.320 --> 31:20.360
I don't care.

31:21.520 --> 31:22.600
What matters

31:24.200 --> 31:25.360
is what you see me as

31:26.520 --> 31:28.040
if I stay.

31:34.400 --> 31:38.040
I'm content that I
got to spend half a day with you.

31:39.160 --> 31:42.440
But what I really want
is for you to give me an answer soon.

31:43.320 --> 31:45.080
What exactly am I to you?

31:56.760 --> 31:57.720
Goodbye.

32:22.760 --> 32:25.000
You're so distracted

32:25.080 --> 32:26.800
that you didn't even notice
me approaching.

32:29.360 --> 32:30.840
If you have something to say,
Elder, say it.

32:34.800 --> 32:36.160
Xuechen,

32:36.240 --> 32:38.880
I've watched you grow up.

32:38.960 --> 32:40.480
Don't lie to me.

32:41.600 --> 32:44.480
You treat Mu Xuanling very differently.

32:46.600 --> 32:48.240
Look at Snow City.

32:48.320 --> 32:50.840
It seems peaceful and serene at night,

32:51.480 --> 32:53.000
but you know better than anyone

32:54.440 --> 32:55.480
how much turbulence lies beneath.

32:56.720 --> 32:59.400
It's your responsibility to protect
the people of Snow City.

33:00.440 --> 33:02.000
One day, you'll also need to protect
the Immortal Alliance

33:02.080 --> 33:03.200
and the Humans.

33:03.280 --> 33:06.160
You should know better than me
if Mu Xuanling can outweigh

33:06.240 --> 33:09.160
your responsibilities
as the Lord of Snow City.

33:13.680 --> 33:17.720
But she's never done anything wrong.

33:18.360 --> 33:19.560
She's even been helping me all along.

33:22.560 --> 33:23.440
Elder,

33:25.320 --> 33:28.480
do I really have to choose
between the world and her?

33:29.920 --> 33:31.120
If it weren't Mu Xuanling,

33:31.920 --> 33:34.040
but my father, you,

33:34.120 --> 33:36.240
the other disciples of Snow City,

33:36.320 --> 33:38.000
or the common people down there,

33:39.320 --> 33:40.720
would I still be expected

33:42.560 --> 33:44.160
to abandon them in a time of crisis?

33:45.960 --> 33:47.920
If one person is as innocent

33:48.000 --> 33:50.480
as the other 100 or 10,000 people,

33:51.400 --> 33:53.200
how do we measure the value of a life?

33:53.280 --> 33:56.200
Does sacrificing the few to save the many

33:56.760 --> 33:58.240
truly count as righteousness?

33:59.320 --> 34:01.600
Your faith is wavering.

34:01.680 --> 34:02.800
Yes,

34:04.240 --> 34:05.320
I have doubts.

34:07.120 --> 34:09.880
The righteous path
has always been rugged and difficult.

34:10.600 --> 34:12.239
Those who walk it must walk alone.

34:12.320 --> 34:13.880
This is an ancient truth.

34:13.960 --> 34:16.040
Does being ancient make it right?

34:22.360 --> 34:23.960
Don't worry, Elder.

34:24.760 --> 34:26.320
Though I have doubts,

34:27.040 --> 34:29.520
I will shoulder
the responsibilities I should bear.

34:33.480 --> 34:34.840
The moon is high now.

34:35.719 --> 34:37.880
I promised Xuan Xin
we'd guard the Pearl Tower together.

34:39.000 --> 34:40.199
I'll head over now.

34:46.120 --> 34:47.239
You…

34:47.320 --> 34:48.800
Didn't you leave?

34:50.000 --> 34:52.400
The human realm is truly strange.

34:52.480 --> 34:54.199
You all wanted me to follow the rules,

34:54.880 --> 34:58.160
but now that I have, you're surprised.

35:01.240 --> 35:03.640
Since you're back, stay put and behave.

35:03.720 --> 35:05.320
Are you leaving

35:06.160 --> 35:07.400
without setting up barriers?

35:08.080 --> 35:09.840
You must trust me a lot.

35:09.920 --> 35:10.840
Or perhaps

35:11.440 --> 35:14.120
you think I'm completely
useless and harmless

35:14.720 --> 35:15.960
with my demonic power gone?

35:16.640 --> 35:18.960
You really are something else.

35:19.800 --> 35:20.800
Thanks for the compliment.

35:22.960 --> 35:25.200
-I brought this especially for you.
-What?

35:25.280 --> 35:28.080
Your Lord paid for it,
so it doesn't count as a bribe.

35:32.080 --> 35:34.400
Think of it as a small token
of appreciation from me.

35:36.120 --> 35:38.240
Thank you for taking care of me
these past few days.

35:38.320 --> 35:40.440
Take it, Senior.

35:41.720 --> 35:43.800
Well… I'll take it,

35:44.400 --> 35:46.360
but if you cause trouble,
we'll still report it.

35:47.320 --> 35:48.520
Of course.

36:01.680 --> 36:03.600
-Let's go.
-Goodbye, Seniors.

36:07.120 --> 36:09.000
If only I could truly stay
for 1,000 years.

36:12.320 --> 36:13.640
But Sang Qi is after me.

36:15.440 --> 36:16.920
He never gives up easily.

36:48.600 --> 36:50.120
What's happening to the Sword of Vitality?

36:51.640 --> 36:53.000
What's going on?

36:53.760 --> 36:56.360
Could it be that he's here?

36:58.240 --> 36:59.600
Master, is something wrong?

37:08.440 --> 37:09.520
Master…

37:11.280 --> 37:12.600
Stay here, all of you.

37:14.160 --> 37:15.120
No one is allowed to leave.

37:15.880 --> 37:17.320
-Yes, Master.
-Understood.

37:17.400 --> 37:18.840
When a sword shakes in its scabbard,

37:18.920 --> 37:20.280
it means its master is near.

37:20.360 --> 37:22.480
The Sword of Vitality was passed down
to me after Mother died.

37:22.560 --> 37:23.880
Even Master couldn't win
its acknowledgment.

37:23.960 --> 37:24.880
Who could be nearby?

37:32.880 --> 37:35.440
Sang Qi, it really is you.

37:35.520 --> 37:38.200
My sister's Sword of Vitality
still hasn't forgotten you.

37:41.640 --> 37:42.480
Sword of Vitality?

37:57.280 --> 37:58.240
Su Ningzhen?

38:01.840 --> 38:02.840
Very well.

38:03.480 --> 38:05.760
I'll teach you a lesson

38:05.840 --> 38:07.520
and put you in your place

38:08.720 --> 38:10.040
before I go take the pearl.

38:11.600 --> 38:12.480
Sang Qi,

38:12.560 --> 38:14.320
I'll avenge my sister.

38:14.400 --> 38:15.240
Prepare to die!

38:33.640 --> 38:34.600
You should've known better.

38:45.560 --> 38:47.240
Although everything seems calm right now,

38:48.320 --> 38:50.280
I can't shake the feeling that
something's about to happen.

38:50.360 --> 38:52.200
That's probably because your mind

38:53.000 --> 38:54.480
isn't at peace to begin with.

38:54.560 --> 38:56.200
Keeping a calm mind

38:56.880 --> 38:58.320
isn't easy.

38:58.400 --> 39:00.320
Don't worry, Mr. Xie.

39:01.040 --> 39:02.720
Mr. Nan is a master of arrays.

39:02.800 --> 39:05.840
Besides, you've secretly added
several new arrays

39:05.920 --> 39:08.920
on top of the ones known to the public.

39:10.120 --> 39:11.600
If any Spirit Clan members infiltrate,

39:12.600 --> 39:14.640
they won't be able to hide.

39:32.560 --> 39:34.200
If you want to kill me, do it!

39:52.360 --> 39:53.520
You have a limp?

39:54.840 --> 39:59.160
Enjoying yourself
in the human realm, aren't you?

40:10.840 --> 40:12.760
Is this how you greet your master?

40:16.600 --> 40:17.760
You came after all.

40:18.360 --> 40:19.840
Having spent ten years in the Dark Abyss,

40:19.920 --> 40:21.320
you should know

40:21.400 --> 40:23.000
what happens to traitors.

40:29.360 --> 40:31.280
I considered the consequences

40:32.160 --> 40:33.560
when I made my choice.

40:37.480 --> 40:39.640
Of all my disciples,
you were the one I was most proud of.

40:40.800 --> 40:43.880
I'll give you one last chance.

40:45.000 --> 40:46.280
Think carefully.

40:47.640 --> 40:50.000
Will you return
to the Dark Abyss with me now,

40:50.840 --> 40:55.120
or shall I kill everyone here

40:56.240 --> 40:58.200
and then take you back?

41:08.840 --> 41:10.000
A Spirit clansman breached the array?

41:10.080 --> 41:11.600
Why wasn't there an alarm?

41:13.440 --> 41:14.320
Mu Xuanling!

41:24.640 --> 41:25.760
Sang Qi.

41:27.880 --> 41:29.280
You must be Nan Xuyue.

41:30.200 --> 41:32.600
Did you set up the arrays in the city?

41:33.440 --> 41:34.440
Not bad.

41:34.960 --> 41:36.640
I'll stay out of your plans,

41:38.600 --> 41:40.280
but you must leave Mu Xuanling here.

41:42.840 --> 41:46.080
I don't think you can stop me.

41:55.760 --> 41:56.800
Nan Xuyue!

41:57.640 --> 41:58.480
Are you all right?

42:00.120 --> 42:02.920
Activating the Separation Array
takes a bit of a toll,

42:03.000 --> 42:04.440
but it won't kill me.

42:04.960 --> 42:06.280
The Separation Array?

42:06.920 --> 42:10.200
The fan can temporarily trap Sang Qi,

42:10.280 --> 42:11.920
but it's not a long-term solution.

42:15.000 --> 42:16.240
Time is running out.

42:16.320 --> 42:17.640
I'll set up an array immediately

42:17.720 --> 42:19.560
to send you out of Snow City.

42:20.600 --> 42:22.600
With Sang Qi's power,
he'll break free any moment.

42:22.680 --> 42:23.760
Just go!

42:23.840 --> 42:25.800
With your demonic power gone,
you're incredibly vulnerable.

42:26.960 --> 42:27.800
If he takes you back to the Dark Abyss,

42:27.880 --> 42:30.440
you'll either get killed
or face unbearable torment.

42:30.520 --> 42:32.040
I'm used to it.

42:32.120 --> 42:34.400
This is my destiny.
It has nothing to do with you,

42:35.080 --> 42:36.120
and I shouldn't drag you into it.

42:56.320 --> 42:58.080
-What are you doing?
-Let him go.

42:58.160 --> 42:59.000
I'll return to the Dark Abyss with you.

42:59.760 --> 43:02.720
Your time in the human realm
didn't teach you much,

43:02.800 --> 43:04.880
except how to become more pathetic.

43:04.960 --> 43:06.520
He's not a member
of the Immortal Alliance.

43:06.600 --> 43:08.320
He's no threat to you.

43:09.080 --> 43:10.200
Don't kill him.
